              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Becka"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Super simple to make &amp; such a huge hit with everyone who tried it.\n\nI did modify it a tad. I used 6 eggs instead of just 4. I also thought that adding meat was a great idea, so I cooked up some ground turkey with taco seasoning mix. Delicious!\n\nThis one is definitely a keeper."
